  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">VN2023IUC026A103
01/09/2023 - 31/08/2025
Multidisciplinary cooperation for innovative education &amp; research at Hu&#xe9; University &amp; Hu&#xe9; Province. The IUC aims at harnessing the partner university for its societal role as driver for progress in the province and the country. The programme represents the 2nd phase of the IUC with Hu&#xe9; University. In line with the evaluation and recommendations of the 1ste phase, the 2nd phase articulates the consolidation of achieved progress, sustainability of initiated change, and the valorisation and expansion of achieved and envisaged impact.</narrative>
